<PageTitle>MyVR: The Digital Universe</PageTitle>

<h1>MyVR: The Digital Universe</h1>

<p>
    MyVR is the cloud infrastructure that enables hosting AnyApp Experiences within **Domains**
    to create a virtual digital universe. This infrastructure is designed to reflect reality and
    monetize creativity by providing persistent, shared, and managed environments.
</p>

<h2>Key Features</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Domain Management (Virtual Real Estate)</li>
    <li>Monetization & Royalty Tracking</li>
    <li>Persistent Multi-user Interaction</li>
</ul>